<BaseLayout title="About">
  <main class="prose reading">
    <div class="kicker">About</div>
    <h1>About the Witness</h1>
    <p>BrianReymore.com is a public essay project concerned with power, conscience, civic trust, spiritual desertification, and the protection of what deserves to endure.</p>
    <p>The point is not personal branding. The point is witness: naming what is happening with care, refusing ideological capture, and preserving a place for moral seriousness in a culture increasingly trained to mistake volume for truth.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
